# Raw run output lives here and is git-ignored: it is large and regenerable from
# `configs/**` plus a git SHA plus a seed. Publication-grade artifacts live in
# `artifacts/` and are committed.
#
# Layout:
#   runs/<stage>/<run_id>/manifest.json      what produced this result
#                        /config.resolved.yaml
#                        /events.jsonl        structured, append-only event log
#                        /requests/           raw request + response bodies
#                        /data/               parquet / npz outputs
#                        /logs/run.log
#                        /STATUS
#   runs/_ledger/spend.jsonl                 append-only cost record
